  "ingredients": [
    "9 cloves garlic",
    "1.5 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "1 teaspoon oregano",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 (7 pound) skin-on, bone-in pork shoulder (picnic) roast",
    "1 (1.5 liter) bottle red table wine"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bKHmlDWnot3Buc18h2lNsgwgG8g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-01-2e1038ac320548f4901a10703f7db5ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crush garlic into small pieces in a mortar and pestle. Add olive oil, salt, oregano, and black pepper; mash into a paste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/urIr952yj3RsVhH6IbsfTHHhLR8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-02-5e4a4434e4f34abbaeda051b91cd246c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make 12 deep incisions a few inches apart in roast using a sharp knife. Pack seasoned garlic paste evenly into incisions and over roast.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ntFkY-mFo_3MlWUHXmfDF-2qBiA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-03-3c452b53e4bc40bda9f4c1a553e19e38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer roast to a large bowl. Pour in red wine, covering roast completely. Cover with plastic wrap and let marinate in the refrigerator for 24 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q-DY0VJISI9BMzMzqGJ6A3scOgg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-04-07ca8241df7d43a5b677ce0e4154bbb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discard red wine. Place roast fat-side up in a roasting pan; cover with aluminum foil. Let sit at room temperature for about 30 minutes. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RY7Q5aNTE5HFjYB6DeKy2CVc2DI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-05-bcb40596fce24c139c82e1364b805c24.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place roast in the preheated oven; reduce temperature to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Bake until slightly pink in the center, about 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C86lx_vB68aI0OiL0-Dfk7tRpCM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-06-673f041906a2406599eb0c2bb1b74060.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase temperature to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Uncover roast and continue baking until fat is crispy and an instant-read thermometer inserted into the center reads 160 degrees F (71 degrees C), about 1 hour more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UUzG3q29HqxzyYr12Ym1LP4ZPwc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-07-167a50128d1a4ce19cbc3287aa33450a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and let rest before carving, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TM6guap6g-cACRL1yaKip6IKKBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-254167-best-pernil-ever-VAT-step-08-f6c67ed6a3504a8f9019417a1dfaebdd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254167/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
